       "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/loose.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Order your free Seller's Guide and discover the top strategies to prepare your home for sale, maximize your profit, and sell quickly in today's market.\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\r\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n            line-height: 1.6;\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            padding: 0;\r\n            color: #333;\r\n        }\r\n        header {\r\n            background-color: #8B0000;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            padding: 2rem;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        header h1 {\r\n            margin: 0;\r\n            font-size: 2.5rem;\r\n        }\r\n        header p {\r\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\r\n            margin-top: 0.5rem;\r\n        }\r\n        section {\r\n            padding: 1.5rem;\r\n            margin: 1rem auto;\r\n            max-width: 800px;\r\n            text-align: center;\r\n        }\r\n        form {\r\n            margin-top: 1.5rem;\r\n        }\r\n        form input[type=\"text\"],\r\n        form input[type=\"email\"] {\r\n            width: 90%;\r\n            max-width: 400px;\r\n            padding: 0.75rem;\r\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\r\n            border: 1px solid #ccc;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n        }\r\n        form button {\r\n            background-color: #8B0000;\r\n            color: #fff;\r\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\r\n            border: none;\r\n            border-radius: 5px;\r\n            cursor: pointer;\r\n            font-size: 1rem;\r\n        }\r\n        form button:hover {\r\n            background-color: #6a0000;\r\n        }\r\n        footer {\r\n            background-color: #333;\r\n            color: #ff